      "title": "Mail Focus Reader",
      "summary": "Create a new private application named \"Mail Focus Reader\". The exact technical Application id is mail_focus_reader.\n\nBuild the shortest complete viable mail reading and triage application, not a Gmail clone. Desktop-first UI: a compact folders/labels list on the left and a message list on the right. Selecting a message replaces the list region with the message detail; an explicit Back action restores the list and preserves the selected folder. Only support read/unread, star/unstar, and archive."
